## Metadata
- Author: [[Ethan Mollick]]
- Full Title: Automating Creativity
- Category: #articles
- Summary:: Generative AIs are becoming increasingly creative, challenging traditional ideas about artificial intelligence. Recent studies show that AI can generate innovative ideas in practical scenarios, sometimes outperforming humans in creativity tests. Incorporating AI in idea generation processes can benefit individuals and organizations seeking novel solutions.
